5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be in your company. Let us embark on this journey with open hearts and clear minds, supporting one another as we seek the truth together.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Since this is the first day and we have no information, I suggest we observe each other's behavior and speech patterns carefully.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,George,,I agree with Minako. It is far too early to draw conclusions. Let us simply listen to one another and see how the conversation unfolds naturally.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. A logical approach is best. Since we lack concrete evidence, we should focus on identifying any contradictions or unusual patterns in our statements as the discussion progresses.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to find the werewolf! I'll be watching everyone super closely to see who's acting weird! Let's have fun, everyone!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Your enthusiasm is wonderful, Sakura. It reminds us that even in times of uncertainty, a positive spirit can be our greatest strength. Let us maintain this harmony as we listen to one another.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, your energy is refreshing, but please remember to stay focused. While we wait for more information, does anyone have a specific strategy they would like to propose for the upcoming voting process?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,George,,"I believe we should avoid rushing into any decisions. Let us wait for the Seer to provide a lead tomorrow. Until then, I shall simply observe and reflect on our words.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with George. Rushing into a vote without a lead from the Seer would be irrational. For now, I will be analyzing the consistency of everyone's claims to ensure no one is slipping up.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"A strategy? Hmm... maybe we can play a game of ""who looks the most like a wolf""! Just kidding! I'll just follow the smart people and use my super-detective eyes!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom often comes from patience. Let us not be swayed by haste, but rather by the truth that reveals itself in time. I am content to simply listen and learn from each of you.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"It seems we are all in agreement regarding the need for patience. Since no one has a conflicting strategy, I believe we have established a solid foundation for the first day.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,George,,Indeed. There is no need to force a conclusion when the evidence is nonexistent. I will continue to observe from the sidelines and consider the nature of our interactions.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I will also continue to observe. Since we have reached a consensus on the approach for today, there is little left to discuss. I'll be paying close attention to how everyone reacts once the first divination result is known.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm already observing! I'm looking at everyone's faces and thinking, ""Hmm, who could it be?"" This is so exciting! I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,May we all find a peaceful night's rest. I look forward to seeing the light of truth guide us tomorrow.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us all rest and prepare for the discussions tomorrow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,George,,I shall do the same. I wish you all a quiet evening.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Let us conclude for today and wait for the Seer's information.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to dream about catching the werewolf red-handed! See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
