36,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept peacefully. As the sun rises, let us once again approach our discussion with kindness and a shared desire for the village's safety. Does anyone have news to share?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I have information. I am the Seer, and I divined George last night. The result was that George is human. We can now trust him as a reliable ally in our search for the werewolf.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,George,,"Thank you for the confirmation, Minako. I appreciate your trust. Since I am confirmed as human, I will do my best to help the village, though I shall continue to observe carefully.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, thank you for the information. If you are indeed the Seer, George is now a confirmed asset. However, we must consider the possibility that you are the werewolf claiming the Seer's role to gain trust.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, Minako is the Seer! That's so cool! So George is a good guy! But Asuka is being super serious again... do you think Minako is lying? I hope not, because that would be a scary prank!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""George"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to remain cautious, Asuka, for a discerning mind is a shield for the village. However, let us also give Minako the benefit of trust for now, as harmony often leads us to the truth.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, your caution is logical and necessary. However, if I were the werewolf, claiming the Seer's role and confirming George as human would be a risky move. I believe the most efficient path is to trust this result for now.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,George,,"I agree with Minako. While Asuka's skepticism is a natural part of this process, we cannot ignore a direct lead. If we spend too much time doubting the Seer, we risk letting the werewolf hide in plain sight.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, your point is noted, but efficiency should not override accuracy. If Minako is the werewolf and George is the Possessed, this ""confirmation"" is a calculated move to secure a voting bloc. I will monitor the reactions of others.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Possessed? What's that? It sounds like a spooky ghost! But Asuka, you're making it sound so complicated! I think Minako is being helpful. If we don't trust the Seer, we'll just be guessing in the dark!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us not let suspicion cloud our spirits. While Asuka's logic is sound, we must also consider the value of trust. If we divide ourselves with doubt, we only make the werewolf's task easier. What do you feel, Sakura?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, I appreciate your trust. @Asuka, while your theory about a werewolf-possessed alliance is possible, it is purely speculative. We must act on the information we have. I suggest we focus on those who have not yet revealed their nature.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,George,,"I agree with Minako. Speculation without evidence can be a dangerous distraction. We should focus our attention on Servas, Asuka, and Sakura, as they are the only ones whose roles remain entirely unknown to us.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Servas"",""Asuka"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@George, focusing on the remaining players is logical, but only if we accept Minako's claim. If we do, the pool of suspects is indeed smaller. However, I still find the timing of this confirmation suspiciously convenient.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, you asked me! I think we should trust Minako! She's being so brave telling us everything. Asuka, stop being such a grumpy-pants! If we just keep doubting, the werewolf will be laughing at us! Let's find the bad guy!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such a spirited debate. While Asuka's vigilance is a gift to the village, Sakura's faith is equally precious. Let us move forward with a gentle heart, trusting in our collective wisdom to find the path.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Minako,,"Since we have reached the end of the discussion, it is time to vote. I believe we should trust the information I provided. Asuka, your skepticism is noted, but we must make a decision. I suggest we vote based on current suspicions.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,George,,"I believe we should follow the Seer's lead. Asuka's theories are interesting, but they lack evidence. To avoid wasting a vote, I suggest we look at those who have remained most vague. I will cast my vote based on who seems most suspicious.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will not be swayed by pressure to trust blindly. However, without a counter-claim from another Seer, we have no proof that Minako is lying. I will vote based on who has contributed the least to the logical deduction of the werewolf's identity.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm not a logical-deduction person, but I'm a great guesser! I think Asuka is being way too suspicious of everyone, which is exactly what a werewolf would do to confuse us! I'm voting for Asuka! Let's go!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
