69,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a sorrowful morning indeed. Asuka has departed from us, and Minako has been taken by the night. Such loss reminds us that life is fragile and our time together is precious. We must remain strong for the village.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,George,,"It is a devastating blow to lose two of our companions in a single night. Minako's death is particularly troubling, as she was our only lead. We are now left in a precarious position with very little information.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, what?! Minako is gone? No way! The werewolf is so mean! And Asuka too... this is getting really scary. We have to find the bad guy right now before everyone is gone! Who do you think did it?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Servas,,"In times of great sorrow, we must lean on one another. The loss of Minako is a heavy burden, for she offered us a glimmer of hope. Let us reflect calmly; who would benefit most from her silence?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,George,,"The werewolf clearly viewed Minako as a threat. Since she confirmed me as human, it is highly likely the werewolf wanted to eliminate the Seer before she could provide more information. We must be very careful now.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"If the werewolf killed Minako, then the werewolf is definitely not Minako! But wait, if the werewolf is one of us, they're pretending to be sad right now! @George, you're the only one Minako trusted, so you must help us! Who looks the most wolfy to you?","{""words"":47,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy task you place upon George, Sakura, but remember that the truth often hides in the quietest corners. George, as the one Minako trusted, your perspective is now our most vital compass. What do you see?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George"",""Sakura"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,George,,"I appreciate your trust, Servas, and Sakura. It is a heavy burden indeed. Looking at the situation, the werewolf has successfully removed the Seer and a skeptical voice. Between Servas and Sakura, it is difficult to be certain, but Servas's constant focus on harmony can sometimes be a veil.","{""words"":49,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@George, what?! You're suspecting Servas? But he's so nice and peaceful! Now I'm getting confused... is everyone just pretending? @Servas, you're not a werewolf, right? Please tell me you're a good guy!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Servas,,"My dear Sakura, my heart is as open as the morning sky. I assure you that I seek only the well-being of our village. George, your discernment is a virtue, but please know that my peace comes from a place of genuine love for my neighbors.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,George,,"I appreciate your words, Servas, but in this game, kindness can be the most effective mask. We must prioritize the village's survival over our feelings. I remain unconvinced, and I believe we must act now.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"This is so confusing! George, you're making me scared! Servas is so sweet, but you're so sure! If we pick the wrong person, the werewolf wins! I don't want to be wrong! I'll vote for whoever you think is the wolf, George!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""George"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
